---
const built = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);
---
<footer class="buildlog">
  <span class="buildlog__dot" aria-hidden="true">●</span> last updated {built} · built with Astro · content in Git · hosted on GitHub Pages
</footer>

<style>
  .buildlog { padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 13px; color: var(--faint); }
  .buildlog__dot { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
